  "post_content": "<p>(40 fotos) M&eacute;s de cent persones han participat aquest dissabte a la I Jornada Feminista organitzada per les Festes Alternatives d&#39;Onda (FAO) al Caf&egrave; Druida, del carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45.&nbsp;&nbsp;Despr&eacute;s d&#39;una introducci&oacute; a c&agrave;rrec de Vicent Leon&eacute;s Folch, de FAO, s&#39;ha projectat el documental de TVE &#39;El machismo que no se ve&#39;, seguit d&#39;una taula redona.<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_3301.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafeministafaocafedruida/img_3287.jpg\" alt=\"img_3287\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafeministafaocafedruida/img_3289.jpg\" alt=\"img_3289\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafeministafaocafedruida/img_3290.jpg\" alt=\"img_3290\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafeministafaocafedruida/img_3291.jpg\" alt=\"img_3291\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafeministafaocafedruida/img_3292.jpg\" alt=\"img_3292\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafeministafaocafedruida/img_3294.jpg\" alt=\"img_3294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafeministafaocafedruida/img_3295.jpg\" alt=\"img_3295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafeministafaocafedruida/img_3296.jpg\" alt=\"img_3296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"